\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682860/extras/edb8a0ec4f814774da89c19e6e08d92c.avif?t=1744355200\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every victory, earn loot to enhance your deck. Upgrade cards, abilities, and unlock new, powerful skills to strengthen your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682860/extras/d10adaa894ce80bf915ffd31e47d6433.poster.avif?t=1744355200\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682860/extras/d10adaa894ce80bf915ffd31e47d6433.webm?t=1744355200\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682860/extras/d10adaa894ce80bf915ffd31e47d6433.mp4?t=1744355200\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choices you make will shape your path\u2014plan carefully, upgrade strategically, and prepare for increasingly challenging encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682860/extras/ecb8a8b61134490d74fa816d242976d9.poster.avif?t=1744355200\" width=600 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682860/extras/ecb8a8b61134490d74fa816d242976d9.webm?t=1744355200\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682860/extras/ecb8a8b61134490d74fa816d242976d9.mp4?t=1744355200\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features of The Dark Horde:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20 Starter Decks</strong> \u2013 Experiment with 20 unique decks, each offering different strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Mode</strong> \u2013 Face limitless challenges for continuous fun.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permanent Progression</strong> \u2013 Unlock stronger starting options as you level up.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permanent Rewards</strong> \u2013 Upgrade a card after each victorious run. Forever.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>200+ Cards</strong>  \u2013 Expand your deck from over 200 unique cards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hundreds of Synergies</strong> \u2013 Discover powerful combos for devastating strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High Replayability</strong> \u2013 Every run offers fresh challenges and strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stunning Soundtrack</strong> \u2013 Enjoy an immersive soundtrack by Alexander Nakarada.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Supply of Goblin Looters</strong> \u2013 Send goblins to their doom without a second thought... They make funny noises when they die!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682860/extras/677ffcc67fd9bd18b3e7b064e5a3e4bc.poster.avif?t=1744355200\" width=600 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682860/extras/677ffcc67fd9bd18b3e7b064e5a3e4bc.webm?t=1744355200\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682860/extras/677ffcc67fd9bd18b3e7b064e5a3e4bc.mp4?t=1744355200\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "In The Dark Horde, you control the battlefield with a deck of cards. Summon hordes of minions, cast devastating spells, and tap into the forbidden power of the Four Domains: Death, Destruction, Corruption, and Frost. It\u2019s not just what you\u2019ll conquer, but how you\u2019ll become the most feared Dark Mage!",
    "supported_languages": "English",
    "reviews": "\u201cSo as many of you may know, I am a bit obsessed with games. This obsession causes me to try many, many different games and I thought I might start pointing out the overlooked gems I find. Case in point: The Dark Horde. It's a unique deck builder that mixes a bunch of genres and uses time as it's main currency.\u201d<br>Jesper Myrfors - One of the Authors of Magic: The Gathering<br>",
